MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Three OT rule defects: matched first-drive FGs ended games as ties; after a first-drive
punt the other team's FG did not end the game; after a first-drive FG the second team's
empty possession did not end the game. Fixed on game state (D38). OT's last 3:00 uses the
Q4 late cells (D39). New ot_sd state from 135 real snaps: kick on any down 18.5%, pass
29%, kneel 5% after the first possession (D40). Drive-log attr no longer breaks pd.concat
(D41). K1: P(tie|OT) 18.7 -> 10.4% (real 4.3), OT drive mix now matches, P(|final|=3)
10.6 -> 11.6% (14.5). Suite 93 pass / 3 red.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QMk9gfHmH2aTN5pwMcY52R
